  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><article class=\"pb-12 md:pb-20\"><header class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 container mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-4 pb-8 lg:pb-0 lg:px-0 lg:pr-12 order-last lg:order-first\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-6xl\">Cars &amp; Coffee at Kaiser Classic</h1><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"inline-block text-sm px-3 py-1 border border-black rounded-full\">Event</span></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 block mt-6\">Thank you for a magical day at Kaiser Classic!\nWhat a great turnout! The sun was shining, the cars were gleaming and we were completely overwhelmed by how many people came. Over 150 cars and probably 300 people chose to skip their morning naps to have their morning coffee with us – that means a lot.</span><div class=\"flex mt-6\"><div class=\"mr-2\"><a href=\"/en/authors/bidders-highway\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-full w-[48px]\" src=\"/assets/bidders-highway-63938c17.jpg\"></a></div><div><a href=\"/en/authors/bidders-highway\" class=\"block hover:underline\">Bidders Highway</a><span class=\"block text-neutral-500 text-sm\">June 17, 2025 13:00</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 lg:mb-0\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/04b9698868e52becaf4d7585ad169a79\" width=\"1220\" height=\"840\"></div></div></header><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 my-8 lg:my-12\"><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 auction-body\"><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/6dc96afd-17ab-4608-9018-1583b103e438.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><strong>This is what our passion is all about</strong></p><p>What we are most proud of? The crazy mix of vehicles. A 60s Mustang next to a 90s Mercedes cab, a new Lamborghini and an American fire truck converted into a campervan – all in top condition. You only see this kind of diversity at a Bidders meetup.</p><p>And best of all was meeting you. Your stories, your cars and your commitment make this so special.</p><p>There will be more to come – we promise. Until then: have a fantastic midsummer, and check out some of our favorite pictures from the weekend!</p><p><strong>/The team at Bidders Highway.</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/dcf9a24b-4efd-4537-b0e5-84163ad756aa.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/264a367a-b4d1-45e4-9b38-6767d689f31e.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/bb7787b9-1859-42c2-9dfc-ca8af5c203ef.jpeg\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/54f6bcb4-4aaa-40d4-8d6c-ba6efbda314e.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/c29110fe-d9de-41ac-9ae9-72186e7e0a6a.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/48917436-7881-4ae7-b52c-321028918baf.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/29eea8ba-5c7b-4bdb-8f11-643c1b14d5e3.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/01333cb0-9592-4a7c-a203-15ca55d48cb3.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/80e0c8a5-fe56-4927-9297-bafe75729e9c.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VvKuFN/images/fa28fdba-d26f-4801-8b9a-7f1904fdd6eb.jpeg\" alt=\"Bidders Highway Cars &amp; Coffee\"></p><p><strong>Photo: Alexander Aalto</strong></p></div><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 mt-10 lg:mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">0 Comments</h2><div class=\"mb-16\"><span class=\"block border bg-rose-50 text-neutral-600 p-4 my-4 rounded\">You need to be signed in in order to post comments.</span><ul id=\"comments\"></ul></div></div></div></article><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/en\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">View all our car auctions</a></div></main>",
